32.93341827392578, -710.2415771484375], "widgets_values": ["", 2048, "on", 0.6, 64, 0.8, 0.05, 1.05, 0, 0, false], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 2, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 3, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_length"}, "name": "max_length", "label": "max_length", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_length"}, {"widget": {"name": "sampling_mode.temperature"}, "name": "sampling_mode.temperature", "label": "sampling_mode.temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "sampling_mode.top_k"}, "name": "sampling_mode.top_k", "label": "sampling_mode.top_k", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "top_k"}, {"widget": {"name": "sampling_mode.top_p"}, "name": "sampling_mode.top_p", "label": "sampling_mode.top_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "top_p"}, {"widget": {"name": "sampling_mode.min_p"}, "name": "sampling_mode.min_p", "label": "sampling_mode.min_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "min_p"}, {"widget": {"name": "sampling_mode.repetition_penalty"}, "name": "sampling_mode.repetition_penalty", "label": "sampling_mode.repetition_penalty", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "repetition_penalty"}, {"widget": {"name": "sampling_mode.seed"}, "name": "sampling_mode.seed", "label": "sampling_mode.seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "sampling_mode.presence_penalty"}, "shape": 7, "name": "sampling_mode.presence_penalty", "label": "sampling_mode.presence_penalty", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "presence_penalty"}, {"widget": {"name": "sampling_mode"}, "name": "sampling_mode", "label": "sampling_mode", "type": "COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3", "localized_name": "sampling_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "thinking"}, "shape": 7, "name": "thinking", "label": "thinking", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "thinking"}], "flags": {}, "id": 7, "type": "TextGenerate", "title": "Prompt Enhancer (native)", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.19.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"prompt": true}, "Node name for S&R": "TextGenerate"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [545.5332641601562, 606.7999877929688], "pos": [562.0284423828125, -652.7724609375], "widgets_values": ["这是一张 wikiHow 标志性的教程页面设计图，采用干净的白色背景，整体风格为简洁的扁平化粉彩插画，带有柔和的轮廓线和略显拙劣但亲切的比例特征。页面顶部是醒目的绿色标题文字 'How to Deal With a Large Centipede in Your Home or Workplace'，左侧配有小巧的 wikiHow 标志，下方紧跟副标题 'Co-authored by Dr. Elena Vasquez, Entomologist — Last Updated: March 2026 — Verified'。\n\n页面主体由六个编号步骤组成，每个步骤包含一个 wikiHow 风格的粉彩插画和对应的说明文字：\n\n1. 插画展示一位穿着 polo 衫的女性在柜台上惊讶地举起双手，一只巨大的蜈蚣占据了柜台大部分空间，呈现出略显滑稽的画风。下方文字：'1. Stay calm. The centipede is more scared of you than you are of it. This is not true but it is what people say in these situations and it may help you psychologically. Do not scream. Screaming startles them and a startled centipede can move up to 40mph.'\n\n2. 插画中，同一位女性正在看手机，蜈蚣仍在柜台上观察她。下方文字：'2. Open a food delivery app or locate the nearest source of buffalo wings. Traditional or boneless both work. The centipede does not have a preference. If you only have access to hot wings, these are acceptable but expect the centipede to eat more slowly due to the heat level. Do not substitute chicken tenders. They will know.'\n\n3. 插画显示女性将一个打开的橙色塑料外卖盒放在蜈蚣面前，蜈蚣已经转头看向食物并伸出触角。下方文字：'3. Place the buffalo wings within reach of the centipede. Do not hand-feed on your first encounter — trust must be established gradually. Position the container approximately 6 inches from its head and step back. You will know it is working when the antennae begin to move toward the wings.'\n\n4. 插画中，蜈蚣正在啃食一块鸡翅，女性在稍远处微笑观察。下方文字：'4. Allow the centipede to eat undisturbed. An average large centipede will consume between 4 and 7 wings per feeding session. Do not attempt to take the container away before it is finished. Do not comment on how much it is eating. They are sensitive about this.'\n\n5. 插画显示蜈蚣在柜台上蜷缩成团，显得非常困倦，旁边是一个空的外卖盒，只有骨头和酱汁残留，女性正在将一张折叠的纸巾放在它身边。下方文字：'5. After feeding, the centipede will enter a dormant state lasting 2-4 hours. This is normal. It is not dead. Do not poke it. Use this window to clean up any sauce that has gotten on the counter, the merchandise, or yourself. The centipede will wake up and leave on its own, or it will stay. If it stays, proceed to Step 6.'\n\n6. 插画显示在随后的夜晚，女性坐在柜台后的凳子上，蜈蚣趴在柜台上休息，两人之间有一个打开的外卖盒，女性正从手中递给蜈蚣一块鸡翅，两人的姿态显示这已经持续了一段时间。下方文字：'6. If the centipede returns, repeat Steps 2-5. By the third or fourth session a bond will form. You may begin hand-feeding at this stage. Name it if you want. We recommend something dignified. It has earned your respect.'\n\n页面最底部包含两个小型提示框：左侧提示框文字为 'TIPS: Ranch dressing is acceptable but blue cheese is preferred. If wings are unavailable, mozzarella sticks are an emergency substitute but this will damage the relationship long-term. Most centipedes prefer flats over drums.'；右侧警告框文字为 'WARNINGS: Do not introduce the centipede to other employees during the bonding phase. Jealousy can occur — from the centipede or the employees. Do not Google how many legs it has. The answer will upset you.'。最下方页脚文字为 'Views: 2.4M — 97% of readers found this article helpful.'。整个页面没有边框或边框，内容从上到下排列，视觉效果清晰、整洁。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 34, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 34, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "1.2.5", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "BOOLEAN", "links": [6], "label": "BOOLEAN", "type": "BOOLEAN", 